  "title": {
   "en": "I Became the Successor of the Martial God"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ko": "무신의 후계자가 되었다"
   },
   {
    "en": "I Became the War God’s Successor"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "One day, I suddenly became the protagonist of a game. However, the more you look at this protagonist... the more you'll sigh. He's got the worst stats, the worst talent and zero connections. But still… You have acquired [Heavenly Martial Physique]. You have become the master of the [Martial God's Tome]. “So what? I’m the ultimate veteran player!” He's not just a veteran player— he’s a full-blown obsessive maniac. Thus begins the legendary playthrough of a hardcore veteran!"
  },
